.br
Options: \fI0\-89.999\fR
.IP "\fBazimuth\fR=\fIfloat\fR" 4m
.br
Azimuth of the sun in degrees from north (A)
.br
Options: \fI0\-360\fR
.IP "\fByear\fR=\fIinteger\fR" 4m
.br
